        "TextSection": {
            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "Properdin deficiency is a rare hereditary primary immunodeficiency due to a complement cascade protein anomaly characterized by significantly increased susceptibility to Neisseria species infections. It only affects males typically presenting with severe or fulminant meningococcal disease."
        },
